      "institutionalContext": "Ministry of Earth Sciences (MoES) and the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC)",
      "strategicImportance": "Highly relevant for UPSC GS Paper I (Geophysical phenomena - Monsoons) and GS Paper III (Environment, Disaster Management, and Agriculture).",
